# DESCRIPTION           : This script executes the mcbx4024 exe for TTUM upload HRMS		#
# AUTHOR                : Dileep Rajan                                       		#
# CALLED SCRIPTS        : IGLS_TtumExeExecdp002.com                                                          		#
